{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51788","headline":"君山（句） · 曾弼","name":"君山（句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠压鱼龙窟，寒堆波浪心。\n（以上《诗话总龟》十四引《雅言系述》）（〖1〗杨亿《武夷新集》卷八《刘氏太夫人天水县太君赵氏墓碣铭》：「一女适曾弼，举进士，终殿中丞。\n」赵氏卒于景德二年，年八十六。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曾弼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}